url: "https://www.lexetratio.com"
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  Computational supplement to 'What Conceptual Change Cannot Recover:
  Interface Closure, Epistemic Recoupling and Representational Sealing'
  (Lex et Ratio Working Paper LXR-2026-PHI-RESTCERT-WP). The software
  simulates the three-detector latent-class toy model of §10 of the paper,
  illustrating the distinction between role-level identification,
  statistical label symmetry, and access to stipulated role-exceeding
  structure under interface closure.
